From ec05f7d63522dd789abbd36d1db10ddd50e0b703 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 22 May 2026 19:43:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: remove misplaced root tsx files causing build failures
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Deleted files that Claude Code placed in wrong locations:
- CTASection.tsx (root) → should be components/home/
- HeroSection.tsx (root) → should be components/home/
- HowItWorks.tsx (root) → should be components/home/
- PricingPreview.tsx (root) → should be components/home/
- page.tsx (root) → was duplicate of app/login/page.tsx
- components/Header.tsx → duplicate of components/layout/Header.tsx
- components/ThemeProvider.tsx → duplicate of components/providers/
- app/auth/callback/middleware.ts → wrong location

These files caused TypeScript to fail silently, preventing Vercel from
deploying the fixed admin/login/paystack/logout code.
---
 CTASection.tsx                  |  32 -----
 HeroSection.tsx                 | 114 ---------------
 HowItWorks.tsx                  |  51 -------
 PricingPreview.tsx              | 151 -------------------
 app/auth/callback/middleware.ts |  40 ------
 components/Header.tsx           | 248 --------------------------------
 components/ThemeProvider.tsx    |   3 -
 page.tsx                        | 161 ---------------------
 8 files changed, 800 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 CTASection.tsx
 delete mode 100644 HeroSection.tsx
 delete mode 100644 HowItWorks.tsx
 delete mode 100644 PricingPreview.tsx
 delete mode 100644 app/auth/callback/middleware.ts
 delete mode 100644 components/Header.tsx
 delete mode 100644 components/ThemeProvider.tsx
 delete mode 100644 page.tsx

